  "html": "<p>In Dungeon Runners there are a series of skills that act similar to spells in other games. Skills are designed to enhance your character in different ways. They can be magical attacks, permanent or temporary boosts to your character or even status effects that affect the mobs you are fighting.\n</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Skills_By_Type\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Skills By Type</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Skills_By_Class\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Skills By Class</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Starting_Skills\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Starting Skills</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Fighter\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fighter</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Mage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mage</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Ranger\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ranger</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Non-Player_Skill_Effects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Non-Player Skill Effects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Other\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Skills_By_Type\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Skills By Type</span></h2>\n<p>There are four types of skills in this game. They are:\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Curses\" title=\"Curses\">Curses</a></b> - Add status effects to enemies\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a></b> - Are magical attacks\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a></b> - Are permanent boosts to your character but may have some side effects\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Self_Buff\" title=\"Self Buff\">Self Buff</a></b> - Are temporary boosts to your character\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Skills_By_Class\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Skills By Class</span></h2>\n<p>The skills for each class can be bought from three different trainers in <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a>.  However note that any player may buy any skill from any trainer.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Fighter_Skills\" title=\"Fighter Skills\">Fighter Skills</a></b> - taught by <a href=\"/wiki/Lothar_of_the_Mound_People\" title=\"Lothar of the Mound People\">Lothar of the Mound People</a> - and include barbarian (non element) weapon skills and divine element skills.\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Skills\" title=\"Mage Skills\">Mage Skills</a></b> - taught by <a href=\"/wiki/Abel_Tukahst\" title=\"Abel Tukahst\">Abel Tukahst</a> - and include most of the fire, ice and shadow element skills, as well as a few others.\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Ranger_Skills\" title=\"Ranger Skills\">Ranger Skills</a></b> - taught by <a href=\"/wiki/Gwen_of_the_Tree_Folk\" title=\"Gwen of the Tree Folk\">Gwen of the Tree Folk</a> - and include all of the poison element skills in the game, a few of other elements, and all the ranged (non element) weapon skills.\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Starting_Skills\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Starting Skills</span></h2>\n<p>Each <a href=\"/wiki/Class\" title=\"Class\">Class</a> has 4 starting skills, these include 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passives</a> and 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a> skills, one of which is single target and the other is an area of effect skill.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Fighter\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Fighter</span></h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Description\n</th><th>Skill Type\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Butcher.png\" title=\"Image:Butcher.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Butcher.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Butcher.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Butcher\" title=\"Butcher\">Butcher</a>\n</td><td>Damage and Increases attack rating\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Righteous-stomp.png\" title=\"Image:Righteous-stomp.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Righteous-stomp.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Righteous-stomp.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Righteous_Stomp\" title=\"Righteous Stomp\">Righteous Stomp</a>\n</td><td>Damage and Knock back\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Gym-freak.png\" title=\"Image:Gym-freak.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Gym-freak.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Gym-freak.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Gym_Freak\" title=\"Gym Freak\">Gym Freak</a>\n</td><td>Increases Health per Endurance point, Strength and Agility. Decreases Mana per Intellect Point, Ranged Attack Speed, Intellect and Endurance\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Way-of-the-roo.png\" title=\"Image:Way-of-the-roo.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Way-of-the-roo.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Way-of-the-roo.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Roo\" title=\"Way of the Roo\">Way of the Roo</a>\n</td><td>Increases Melee speed. Decreases Ranged attack speed and Magic damage\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a>\n</td></tr></table><br/>\n<a name=\"Mage\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Mage</span></h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Description\n</th><th>Skill Type\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire-bolt.png\" title=\"Image:Fire-bolt.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Fire-bolt.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fire-bolt.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\">Fire Bolt</a>\n</td><td>Damage\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Shadow-lightning.png\" title=\"Image:Shadow-lightning.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Shadow-lightning.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Shadow-lightning.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lightning\" title=\"Shadow Lightning\">Shadow Lightning</a>\n</td><td>Damages Up To 5 Targets\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Bookworm.png\" title=\"Image:Bookworm.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Bookworm.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Bookworm.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Bookworm\" title=\"Bookworm\">Bookworm</a>\n</td><td>Increases Mana per Intellect point, Endurance and Intellect. Decreases Health per Endurance Point, Agility and Strength\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Mental-prowess.png\" title=\"Image:Mental-prowess.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Mental-prowess.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Mental-prowess.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Prowess\" title=\"Mental Prowess\">Mental Prowess</a>\n</td><td>Increases magic damage. Decreases Melee and Ranged attack speed\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a>\n</td></tr></table><br/>\n<a name=\"Ranger\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Ranger</span></h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Description\n</th><th>Skill Type\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" title=\"Image:Poison-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Poison-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Shot\" title=\"Poison Shot\">Poison Shot</a>\n</td><td>Damage over Time\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" title=\"Image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Blast\" title=\"Gaseous Blast\">Gaseous Blast</a>\n</td><td>AoE Damage\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Average-bmi.png\" title=\"Image:Average-bmi.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Average-bmi.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Average-bmi.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Average_BMI\" title=\"Average BMI\">Average BMI</a>\n</td><td>Increases Health per Endurance point, Endurance and Agility. Decreases Mana per Intellect Point, Intellect and Strength\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Trigger-happy.png\" title=\"Image:Trigger-happy.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Trigger-happy.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Trigger-happy.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Trigger_Happy\" title=\"Trigger Happy\">Trigger Happy</a>\n</td><td>Increases Ranged Attack Speed. Decreases Melee Attack speed and Magic Damage\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a>\n</td></tr></table><br/>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Non-Player_Skill_Effects\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Non-Player Skill Effects</span></h2>\n<p>The following are effects from enemy attack or curses that affect the player. The actual skill names may not be known since we cannot see what enemies are casting.<br/><br/>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Description\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Skill Type\n</th></tr>\n<small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by.</small>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Agility_Bonus.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Agility_Bonus.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Agility_Bonus.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Agility_Bonus.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Agility Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Agility increased by 10%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Agility Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_MeleeAttackRating_Debuff_on.png\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_MeleeAttackRating_Debuff_on.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_MeleeAttackRating_Debuff_on.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_MeleeAttackRating_Debuff_on.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Attack Curse\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">-25% attack rating.  15 second duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\">Dark Angels</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_PallofFear_on_43px.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_PallofFear_on_43px.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_PallofFear_on_43px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_PallofFear_on_43px.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Banshee Curse\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">The curse of the Banshee is upon thee!  8 second duration. Cast by Banshees.<br/> Curse has effects like any Fear spell. In addition, a 40 second Bravery buff is applied at the same time to prevent multiple Banshee curses.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Bravery_on_43px.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Bravery_on_43px.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Bravery_on_43px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Bravery_on_43px.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Bravery\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">You feel really brave and have gained immunity to Fear effects!  40 second duration. (See also, above Bravery entry.)\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Drain_Bamage_Debuff.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Drain_Bamage_Debuff.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Drain_Bamage_Debuff.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Drain_Bamage_Debuff.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Dain Bamage\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Intellect reduced by 25%!  20 second duration. Cast by Divine Juggernaut.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_DamageCurse_Debuff_on.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_DamageCurse_Debuff_on.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_DamageCurse_Debuff_on.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_DamageCurse_Debuff_on.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Damage Curse\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">-25% melee damage.  15 second duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\">Divine Angels</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Endurance_Bonus.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Endurance_Bonus.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Endurance_Bonus.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Endurance_Bonus.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Endurance Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Endurance increased by 10%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Endurance Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Enfeeble.jpg\" title=\"Image:Enfeeble.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Enfeeble.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Enfeeble.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Enfeeble\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">-20% attack speed. -20% Melee damage!  60 second duration. Cast by shaman champions.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_FireResist_Debuff_on.png\" title=\"Image:Effect Icon- FireResist_Debuff_on.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect Icon- FireResist_Debuff_on.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_FireResist_Debuff_on.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Flammable\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Fire Damage Resistance Reduced by 40!  15 second duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abaddon</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_IceResist_Debuff.png\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_IceResist_Debuff.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_IceResist_Debuff.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_IceResist_Debuff.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Frostbite\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Movement speed reduced by 40%! 20 second duration.  Cast by Frostbitten Blaster.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Intellect_Bonus.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Intellect_Bonus.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Intellect_Bonus.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Intellect_Bonus.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Intellect Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Intellect increased by 10%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Intellect Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_MovementSpeed_Debuff_on.png\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_MovementSpeed_Debuff_on.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_MovementSpeed_Debuff_on.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Effect_Icon-_MovementSpeed_Debuff_on.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Hamstring\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">You are slowed down by a torn hamstring!  5 second duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon's_Guard\" title=\"Abaddon's Guard\">Abaddon's Guard</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Invulnerable_on_43px.png\" title=\"Image:Invulnerable_on_43px.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Invulnerable_on_43px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Invulnerable_on_43px.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Poison Blast\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">You got caught in the blast, and are now receiving Poison Damage over time.   10 second duraton.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Frenzy_on_43px.jpg\" title=\"Image:Frenzy_on_43px.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Frenzy_on_43px.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Frenzy_on_43px.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Rend\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Ouch! You're Bleeding!  5 second duraton. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Wolves</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Slow.png\" title=\"Image:Slow.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Slow.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Slow.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Slow\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">-10% attack speed. -10% movement speed!\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Strength_Bonus.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Strength_Bonus.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Strength_Bonus.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Strength_Bonus.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Strength Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Strength increased by 10%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Strength Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Widow's_Curse.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Widow's Curse.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Widow's Curse.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Widow's_Curse.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Widow's Curse\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">You cannot use any abilities and your mana is being drained!  10 Second duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Widow_Maker\" title=\"Widow Maker\">Widow Maker</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Widow's_Prison.jpg\" title=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Widow's Prison.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Effect_Icon-_Widow's Prison.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Effect_Icon-_Widow's_Prison.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Widow's Prison\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Your movement is impaired and your health is being drained!  10 Second duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Widow_Maker\" title=\"Widow Maker\">Widow Maker</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Fire-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Fire-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Fire-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Fire-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Fire Resistance Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Fire Resistance increased by 125%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Fire Resistance Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Ice-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Ice-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Ice-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Ice-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Ice Resistance Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Ice Resistance increased by 125%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Ice Resistance Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Poison-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Poison-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Poison-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Poison-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Poison Resistance Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Poison Resistance increased by 125%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Poison Resistance Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Shadow-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Shadow-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Shadow-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Shadow-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Shadow Resistance Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Shadow Resistance increased by 125%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Shadow Resistance Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Divine-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Divine-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Divine-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Divine-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Divine Resistance Bonus\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Divine Resistance increased by 125%.  5 Minute duration. Cast by <a href=\"/wiki/Shrines\" title=\"Shrines\">Divine Resistance Shrine</a>.\n</td><td>Effect\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Other\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Other</span></h2>\n<p>Skills/effects that are not used by the player or enemies are listed here.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th>Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Description\n</th><th>Skill Type\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Resurrection-sickness.jpg\" title=\"Image:Resurrection-sickness.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Resurrection-sickness.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Resurrection-sickness.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td>Resurrection Sickness\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left;\">75% decrease to <a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Rating\" title=\"Defense Rating\">Defense Rating</a> and ALL Damage you inflict for 3 minutes. Serves as the death penalty in <a href=\"/wiki/Horrific_Dungeon_of_Legend\" title=\"Horrific Dungeon of Legend\">HDoL</a>.\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Curses\" title=\"Curses\">Curses</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Zone-spawn-invulnerability.jpg\" title=\"Image:Zone-spawn-invulnerability.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Zone-spawn-invulnerability.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Zone-spawn-invulnerability.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Zone_Spawn_Invulnerability\" title=\"Zone Spawn Invulnerability\">Zone Spawn Invulnerability</a>\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left;\">Gives player temporary immunity to damage for 60 seconds or until the player moves or uses a skill/item. Also does not <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Aggro\" title=\"Aggro\">aggro</a> enemies.\n</td><td>unknown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Quest_reward.jpg\" title=\"Image:Quest reward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Quest reward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Quest_reward.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Quest_Reward\" title=\"Quest Reward\">Quest Reward</a>\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left;\">You have a fever for questing and the only prescription is this 15% bonus to all experience gained.<br/>Time does not elapes in town: (followed by time remaining in minutes)\n</td><td>none\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Free_player_wheelchair.jpg\" title=\"Image:Free_player_wheelchair.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Free_player_wheelchair.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Free_player_wheelchair.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Free_player\" title=\"Free player\">Free player</a>\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left;\">Appears when you are a free player. Invites you to join and lists the advantages of membership: can use all the items, level 15% faster, 15% more gold, pay less for King's Coin items, five bank pages, and no advertisements.\n</td><td>none\n</td></tr></table><br/>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
